// Wood beams placed one by one across an 8-wide pit (anchored at both ends, light load) stay put:
// placed structure is rigid, it doesn't flow or roll like powder.
map
######################
#....................#
#....................#
#....................#
#....................#
#.@..................#
#####........#########
#####........#########
#####........#########
######################
end
place 2 3 1 WoodPillar
place 3 4 1 WoodPillar
place 4 5 1 WoodPillar
place 5 6 1 WoodPillar
place 6 7 1 WoodPillar
place 7 8 1 WoodPillar
place 8 9 1 WoodPillar
place 9 10 1 WoodPillar
// a cantilever stub of iron off the far wall too
place 10 3 0 IronBeam
place 11 4 0 IronBeam
give IronBeam 4
expect 10 count:WoodBeam == 8
expect 400 count:WoodBeam == 8
expect 400 count:IronBeam == 2
expect 400 crumbled == 0
